      "en": "They wandered in the wilderness in a desert way. They found no city to live in.",
      "ko": "저희가 광야 사막 길에서 방황하며 거할 성을 찾지 못하고",
      "source_text_hash": "5380bf5985010b4e489818992c70d714f88bd5de384612ad1110e59e31f31b81",
      "translation_text_hash": "900d2e09150abea9e79264a559ab706f2ae9e4b1b61da8461b6baf7643345888",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
