      "en": "Hungry and thirsty, their soul fainted in them.",
      "ko": "주리고 목마름으로 그 영혼이 속에서 피곤하였도다",
      "source_text_hash": "1407d4de0c85ba328e4374647299858841db3d87ffa85f3aabaa09a312eb4fe3",
      "translation_text_hash": "c651145e777ef0e305bdebebb9894dd2264221d34d0e1a733a63b030f96b90d2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
